                                    Login to Your Account →
                                </a>
                            </div>

                            <p style="margin:0; color:#6b7280; font-size:14px; line-height:1.7;">If you have any questions, feel free to <a href="http://127.0.0.1:8000/contact" style="color:#16a34a; text-decoration:underline;">contact us</a>.</p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <!-- Footer -->
                    <tr>
                        <td style="background-color:#f9fafb; border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding:24px 40px; text-align:center;">
                            <p style="margin:0; color:#9ca3af; font-size:13px;">Best regards, <strong style="color:#374151;">The YouZoo Team</strong></p>
                            <p style="margin:8px 0 0; color:#d1d5db; font-size:12px;">© 2026 YouZoo. All rights reserved.</p>
